      "content": "The weight of perceived failure is immense, but that feeling of being \"done\" is a symptom of the pain, not a factual statement about your worth. You are trapped in a cycle of self-blame, and that is exhausting. If the idea of fighting feels too heavy, please consider reaching out to a mental health professional who can help you navigate this intense despair. They can provide the support you need to see a way through this darkness.",
